---
import HubLayout from '../layouts/HubLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Illustration from '../components/illustrations/Illustration.astro';
import type { IllustrationKey, Tone } from '../lib/site';
const steps: { title: string; text: string; href: string; link: string; tone: Tone; art?: IllustrationKey; icon: string }[] = [
  { title: 'Store 3 days of water', text: 'Your household total, pets included.', href: '/tools/water-storage-calculator/', link: 'Water calculator', tone: 'water', art: 'water-storage', icon: 'droplet' },
  { title: 'Stock 3 days of food', text: 'Food that needs no fridge or mains power.', href: '/tools/food-storage-calculator/', link: 'Food calculator', tone: 'food', art: 'food-cupboard', icon: 'wheat' },
  { title: 'Get ready for a power cut', text: 'Torches, a radio, a power bank, warm layers.', href: '/guides/preparing-for-a-power-cut/', link: 'Power cut guide', tone: 'power', art: 'power-cut', icon: 'flashlight' },
  { title: 'Agree a household plan', text: 'Meeting places, contacts, who collects whom.', href: '/guides/family-emergency-plan/', link: 'Family plan guide', tone: 'home', art: 'family-plan', icon: 'users' },
  { title: 'Pack a grab bag', text: 'The essentials, ready by the door.', href: '/guides/72-hour-emergency-bag/', link: 'Grab bag guide', tone: 'kits', art: 'grab-bag', icon: 'backpack' },
  { title: 'Gather your documents', text: 'Originals safe, copies somewhere else.', href: '/guides/essential-documents/', link: 'Documents guide', tone: 'docs', art: 'documents', icon: 'file-text' },
];
---
<HubLayout
  title="Start here"
  seoTitle="Start prepping: a beginner's guide for UK households"
  description="New to emergency preparedness? A simple, step-by-step path for UK households, from storing water to making a family plan. Free tools and checklists included."
  intro="Six steps, in order, at your own pace. Aim for 3 days first."
  tone="tools"
  extraGuides={['prepping-for-beginners']}
  toolSlugs={['water-storage-calculator', 'food-storage-calculator', 'preparedness-score']}
>
  <Fragment slot="why">
    <p>You do not need to buy a lot or think about the worst. Being prepared mostly means a few sensible things, done once and checked now and then.</p>
    <p>The UK government's Be Ready campaign suggests being ready to cope for 3 days. Once you have that, build towards a week or two if you can. <a href="/why-prepare/">What the government says to prepare for</a>.</p>
  </Fragment>
  <section aria-labelledby="path-title">
    <h2 id="path-title" class="sr-only">Your path, step by step</h2>
    <ol class="path">
      {steps.map((s, i) => (
        <li class={`card is-link path-card tone-${s.tone}`}>
          <span class="path-num" aria-hidden="true">{i + 1}</span>
          {s.art ? <span class="card-art path-art"><Illustration name={s.art} width={112} /></span> : <span class="chip chip-lg"><Icon name={s.icon} size={28} /></span>}
          <h3 class="card-title"><a href={s.href} class="stretched"><span class="sr-only">Step {i + 1}: </span>{s.title}</a></h3>
          <p class="card-text">{s.text}</p>
          <span class="card-cta" aria-hidden="true">{s.link} <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} /></span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <section class="when-it-happens mt-10" aria-labelledby="when-title">
      <h2 id="when-title" class="text-xl">When something happens</h2>
      <p class="muted mt-1">Two tools for the moment itself. Once a page is open, it keeps working if your connection drops.</p>
      <ul class="card-grid mt-4">
        <li class="card is-link tone-power">
          <span class="chip"><Icon name="refrigerator" size={22} /></span>
          <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/tools/power-cut-food-safety/" class="stretched">Power cut: is my food still safe?</a></h3>
          <p class="card-text">A fridge and freezer countdown from the Food Standards Agency’s time limits.</p>
          <span class="card-cta" aria-hidden="true">Start the countdown <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} /></span>
        </li>
        <li class="card is-link tone-water">
          <span class="chip"><Icon name="glass-water" size={22} /></span>
          <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/tools/water-treatment-calculator/" class="stretched">Water treatment calculator</a></h3>
          <p class="card-text">Boiling, bleach drops per litre, tablets and filters, with a wait timer.</p>
          <span class="card-cta" aria-hidden="true">Treat water <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} /></span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <aside class="done-basics card tone-neutral mt-8" aria-labelledby="done-basics-title">
      <h2 id="done-basics-title" class="text-lg">When you've done the basics</h2>
      <p class="card-text">If you want to, take the optional <a href="/tools/preparedness-score/">Home Preparedness Score</a>, a 5-minute self-check that points out what is left to do.</p>
    </aside>
    <p class="mt-6"><a href="/why-prepare/" class="font-bold">Why prepare? What the UK government says you should be ready for</a></p>
  </section>
</HubLayout>
<style>
  .path { display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr)); counter-reset: none; }
  .path-num {
    position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1rem;
    display: grid; place-items: center; width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--t-chip); color: var(--t-chip-ink); font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 700;
  }
  .done-basics { max-width: 44rem; height: auto; }
</style>
